This is a modified version. Changes made by Meshly.AI:

  - Added ipfilter/, a framework-agnostic IP allowlist policy core with WSGI
    and ASGI adapters. Not imported or enabled by the application; a
    deployment composes it in.
  - Added docs/, notes on Artifact Registry and Cloud Build caching.
  - Added AGENTS-LOCAL.md and RUNNER.xml, instructions for coding agents.
  - Replaced README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md and AGENTS.md. Each is
    pinned by blob hash against a recorded baseline of upstream's tree so the
    set of replaced files cannot grow unnoticed.
  - Replaced the community health files under .github/, and removed
    FUNDING.yml.
  - Changed the deployed entrypoint from run:app to a module of ours.

No file under app/, gcp/, tools/, tests/, the Dockerfile or requirements.txt
is modified as of this writing. README.md records the current measurement.
